  - variational autoencoder
  - class imbalance
  - agricultural AI
  - explainable AI

abstract: >
  CropGuard AI is a deep learning system for automated crop disease classification
  and treatment recommendation, trained on the PlantVillage dataset (10-class subset).
  The system uses a ResNet50 backbone augmented with dual CBAM attention modules,
  achieving ≥94.0% test accuracy and ≥0.910 Macro F1. A convolutional VAE resolves
  the Potato Healthy class imbalance (152→664 images, FID=42.7), improving that
  class's F1 from 0.000 to ≥0.700. Grad-CAM provides visual explanations for
  disease localization decisions.

